                  "value" : "<sup>1</sup>. Subs. by Act 38 of 1994, s. 3, for section 3 (w.e.f. 10-5-1995).<br/><hr style=\"border: none; margin-bottom: 3px; margin-top: 0;\"/> <hr style=\"border: none; margin-bottom: 3px; margin-top: 0;\"/><br/><hr style=\"border: none; margin-bottom: 3px; margin-top: 0;\"/>",
