                  "value" : "<span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><sup>1</sup>[<b>3. Meaning of publication.</b>--For the purposes of this Act, \"publication\" means making a work available to the public by issue of copies or by communicating the work to the public.] <br/><hr style=\"border: none; margin-bottom: 8px; margin-top: 0;\"/>",
