                "dc.identifier.repealed" : [ {
                  "value" : "false",
                  "language" : null,
                  "authority" : null,
                  "confidence" : -1,
                  "place" : 0
                } ],
                "dc.identifier.section_footnote" : [ {
                  "value" : "<sup>1</sup>. Subs. by Act 38 of 1994, s. 4, for section 6 (w.e.f. 10-5-1995). <br/><hr style=\"border: none; margin-bottom: 3px; margin-top: 0;\"/> <sup>2</sup>. Subs. by Act 33 of 2021, s. 10, for “Appellate Board” (w.e.f. 4-4-2021). <br/><hr style=\"border: none; margin-bottom: 3px; margin-top: 0;\"/> <sup>3</sup>. The words and figures “constituted under section 11 whose decision thereon shall be final” omitted by Act 33 of 2021, s. 10 (w.e.f. 4-4-2021).<br/><hr style=\"border: none; margin-bottom: 3px; margin-top: 0;\"/>",
                  "language" : null,
                  "authority" : null,
                  "confidence" : -1,
                  "place" : 0
                } ],
                "dc.identifier.section_id" : [ {
                  "value" : "14508",
                  "language" : null,
                  "authority" : null,
                  "confidence" : -1,
                  "place" : 0
                } ],
                "dc.identifier.section_number" : [ {
                  "value" : "6",
                  "language" : null,
                  "authority" : null,
                  "confidence" : -1,
                  "place" : 0
                } ],
                "dc.identifier.section_page_note" : [ {
                  "value" : "<span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><sup>1</sup><b>[6. Certain disputes to be decided by <sup>2</sup>[Commercial Court].--</b>If any question arises-- <br/><hr style=\"border: none; margin-bottom: 8px; margin-top: 0;\"/> <span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span> (a) whether a work has been published or as to the date on which a work was published for the purposes of Chapter V, or <br/><hr style=\"border: none; margin-bottom: 8px; margin-top: 0;\"/> <span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span> <span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span> (b) whether the term of copyright for any work is shorter in any other country than that provided in respect of that work under this Act, <br/><hr style=\"border: none; margin-bottom: 8px; margin-top: 0;\"/> <span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span> it shall be referred to the <sup>2</sup>[Commercial Court] <sup>3</sup>****: <br/><hr style=\"border: none; margin-bottom: 8px; margin-top: 0;\"/> <span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span> Provided that if in the opinion of the <sup>2</sup>[Commercial Court], the issue of copies or communication to the public referred to in section 3 was of an insignificant nature, it shall not be deemed to be publication for the purposes of that section.] <br/><hr style=\"border: none; margin-bottom: 8px; margin-top: 0;\"/> <span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><br/><hr style=\"border: none; margin-bottom: 8px; margin-top: 0;\"/>",
                  "language" : null,
                  "authority" : null,
                  "confidence" : -1,
                  "place" : 0
                } ],
