                "dc.identifier.section_footnote" : [ {
                  "value" : "<sup>1</sup>. Subs. by Act 38 of 1994, s. 14, for section 38 (w.e.f. 10-5-1995).<br/><hr style=\"border: none; margin-bottom: 3px; margin-top: 0;\"/> <sup>2</sup>. Subs. by 49 of 1999, s. 4, for \"twenty-five years\" (w.e.f. 15-1-2000).<br/><hr style=\"border: none; margin-bottom: 3px; margin-top: 0;\"/> <sup>3</sup>. Omitted by Act 27 of 2012, s. 26 (w.e.f. 21-6-2012).<br/><hr style=\"border: none; margin-bottom: 3px; margin-top: 0;\"/>",
                  "language" : null,
                  "authority" : null,
                  "confidence" : -1,
                  "place" : 0
                } ],
                "dc.identifier.section_id" : [ {
                  "value" : "14552",
                  "language" : null,
                  "authority" : null,
                  "confidence" : -1,
                  "place" : 0
                } ],
                "dc.identifier.section_number" : [ {
                  "value" : "38",
                  "language" : null,
                  "authority" : null,
                  "confidence" : -1,
                  "place" : 0
                } ],
                "dc.identifier.section_page_note" : [ {
                  "value" : "<span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><b><sup>1</sup>[38. Performer's right.</b>-- (1) Where any performer appears or engages in any performance, he shall have a special right to be known as the \"performer's right\" in relation to such performance.<br/><hr style=\"border: none; margin-bottom: 8px; margin-top: 0;\"/> <span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span> (2) The performer's right shall subsist until <sup>2</sup>[fifty years] from the beginning of the calendar year next following the year in which the performance is made.<br/><hr style=\"border: none; margin-bottom: 8px; margin-top: 0;\"/> <sup>3</sup>*<span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span> *<span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span> *<span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span> *<span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span> *]",
                  "language" : null,
                  "authority" : null,
                  "confidence" : -1,
                  "place" : 0
                } ],
